# Black Panther, Hope Enduring blocks Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla, and Bot1 casts Fog ("Prevent all combat damage that would
# be dealt this turn"). The Gorilla's 2 to Black Panther meets two prevention effects, Black Panther's own and Fog's: each
# would prevent all of it and use nothing up, so whichever applies first leaves the same game (CR 616.1), and Bot1 is not
# asked to order them; the damage is prevented once (CR 615.6). Black Panther's 3 in each combat damage step (double
# strike) is prevented by Fog. Three preventions, no damage marked on either creature, and Bot1's life untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
King T'Challa
Fog
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.King T'Challa.Cast(Ability: back face)
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Guerrilla Gorilla > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Black Panther, Hope Enduring > Guerrilla Gorilla)
[T4 Bot2.DeclareBlockers]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fog.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Panther, Hope Enduring.Damage = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Guerrilla Gorilla.Damage = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Fog; Black Lotus
Prevented.Count = 3
